WEBVTT

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:05.540
Wow, this is my new town, huh?

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:13.180
Alright!

00:00:17.380 --> 00:00:19.990
I ain't gonna lose to no Kantou people!

00:01:50.800 --> 00:01:53.710
Doremi-chan, yesterday was really fun, wasn't it?

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:56.220
It was the worst for me!

00:01:56.970 --> 00:02:02.390
Everyone ate my share of the steak that you didn't eat!

00:02:02.390 --> 00:02:03.600
Don't you think that's cruel!?

00:02:05.770 --> 00:02:07.560
They're the worst family ever!

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:11.560
Ahh, I'm the world's unluckiest pretty girl.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:14.690
Ahh! You over there, I can see yer panties!

00:02:17.030 --> 00:02:20.490
Yer pretty dumb! There's no way I could see 'em when yer wearin' shorts!

00:02:23.780 --> 00:02:24.910
What a weird reaction!

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:26.080
Well then, see ya!

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:28.250
W-Wait a sec!

00:02:28.250 --> 00:02:29.750
What was with that girl?

00:02:29.750 --> 00:02:31.960
I've never seen her before...

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:42.390
The Transfer Student From Naniwa! Aiko Debuts.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.690
So, let's do it at your house!

00:02:50.770 --> 00:02:52.650
Doremi, I can see your panties!

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.530
I'm wearing shorts, there's no way you could see them, moron!

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:58.900
You okay, Kotake?

00:02:59.320 --> 00:02:59.950
Yeah...

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:02.280
What's wrong with her?

00:03:02.990 --> 00:03:07.700
Doremi-chan's not in a good mood today, so I think it would be better if you didn't tease her.

00:03:07.700 --> 00:03:08.910
O-Oh, really...

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:12.170
Okay everyone, get back to your seats!

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:16.670
Stand!

00:03:17.590 --> 00:03:18.420
Bow!

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:21.000
Good morning!

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:22.130
Morning.

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:23.260
Be seated!

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:28.890
Before we start class, I'd like to introduce a new classmate.

00:03:28.890 --> 00:03:29.980
A transfer student?

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.310
Come on in.

00:03:34.820 --> 00:03:36.900
Doremi-chan... Doremi-chan, look!

00:03:39.440 --> 00:03:41.780
Ah, yer in my class?

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.200
What's this, friends already?

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:45.700
No, we're not!

00:03:46.740 --> 00:03:48.910
We just talked a little this morning.

00:03:48.910 --> 00:03:49.950
I see.

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:52.460
Well then, can I have you do a little self-introduction?

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:53.330
Sure!

00:03:56.710 --> 00:04:00.380
My name's written with the kanji for li'l sister and tail, Senoo!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.380
Senoo Aiko!

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:05.140
I moved here from a place called Tengachaya in Osaka!

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:07.510
Hmm, a real Kansai person, huh?

00:04:07.510 --> 00:04:10.930
Sounds weird when ya put it like that.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.640
Instead of calling me Kansai person, just call me Naniwa girl!

00:04:13.640 --> 00:04:16.480
Oh, well, I'm sooo sorry about that, puripuri-puripuri...

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:17.690
Ye-ah!

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.070
Yuck...

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:20.940
Look here, SOS Trio!

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:22.700
Don't interrupt her self-introduction!

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:24.030
SOS Trio?

00:04:25.240 --> 00:04:26.490
The S is for Sagawa!

00:04:26.490 --> 00:04:27.240
The O is for Oten!

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.620
And S for Sugiyama!

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:31.370
We are...

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:34.620
The three keepers of justice: The SOS Trio!

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:35.710
Nice-to-meet-you!

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:37.580
Is that right?

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:38.710
I was thinkin' it was the Three Worthless Idiots Trio!

00:04:38.710 --> 00:04:42.170
Sukuyounonai Oboke Sanbaka

00:04:45.260 --> 00:04:46.180
That's good!

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:48.390
Teacher!

00:04:48.390 --> 00:04:49.510
Sorry, sorry...

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:50.930
Aiko, go on.

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.430
Where was I again?

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:55.560
You were saying that you moved here from Tengachaya.

00:04:55.560 --> 00:04:56.690
Ah, that's right!

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:58.480
Lesse...

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:01.570
I ain't great at studyin' but I love gym classes!

00:05:01.570 --> 00:05:05.360
And a hobby of mine is singin' really loud in the bath!

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:08.030
Well, that's 'bout it, so it's nice meetin' all of ya.

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:13.200
Let's see, your seat will be...

00:05:13.200 --> 00:05:17.080
That's right, the seat behind Doremi is open, so let's have you sit there.

00:05:17.080 --> 00:05:17.620
'Kay!

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:21.420
So yer Doremi, huh?

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:25.050
Yer hairstyle's pretty unique, but ya sure got a funny name.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:27.220
Senoo-san...?

00:05:27.220 --> 00:05:29.550
Hm? Ai-chan's fine.

00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:34.060
Well then, Ai-chan, what you just said was rude to Doremi-chan.

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:34.810
Really?

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:36.810
Ah, I'm sorry.

00:05:37.310 --> 00:05:38.350
By the way, you're...?

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:40.060
Me?

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:41.730
My name's Fujiwara Hadzuki...

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:42.820
Hadzuki-chan!

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:44.820
Haven't I metcha somewhere before?

00:05:44.820 --> 00:05:48.280
E-Eh... You have, I was with Doremi-chan.

00:05:48.280 --> 00:05:49.530
Is that right?

00:05:49.530 --> 00:05:53.450
Doremi-chan's impact was so great, I didn't remember.

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.420
What's wrong?

00:05:57.420 --> 00:06:01.130
You mean I'm just in her shadow?

00:06:01.130 --> 00:06:06.720
Your clothes 'n' speach scream stuck up bookworm, so that might be it.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:07.970
That's cruel!

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.590
Hey, that's going a little too far!

00:06:10.390 --> 00:06:11.760
Be quiet over there!

00:06:14.640 --> 00:06:17.020
She caught the teacher's killer chalk...

00:06:17.020 --> 00:06:19.060
Spectacular!

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:20.690
Thank you!

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:27.490
Oh, even the boys couldn't clear that many!

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:29.320
Ai-chan, that was amazing!

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:32.780
All that because she can clear a few vaulting boxes?

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:37.160
Girls are truely great only when they're popular with the boys!

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:45.300
Oh, so you were raised by your father?

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:47.840
It was only difficult the first few months.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:52.090
Senoo's initial is S, so we could let you into the SOS Trio!

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:54.390
If I got in, it wouldn't be a trio anymore!

00:06:54.390 --> 00:06:55.180
Really?

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:58.480
I could join if ya kicked Sagawa-kun out.

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:00.890
Just kiddin'!

00:07:02.060 --> 00:07:05.900
Ahh, don't scare me like that, you bully!

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:07.530
Yer hopeless!

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:11.240
She sure did get popular quickly.

00:07:11.240 --> 00:07:13.160
I hate that girl!

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:13.950
Me too.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:18.540
She's so cheerful, but she says things that can hurt others without a care!

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:22.580
And just saying whatever comes to mind isn't very good either...

00:07:30.840 --> 00:07:33.760
She just transferred here, and she already has shopping plans.

00:07:43.980 --> 00:07:46.360
Silly me, why am I getting all flustered?

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.570
Now's the time for magic!

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:08.340
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:08:18.850 --> 00:08:20.720
Ah, I only have one magic sphere left.

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:23.310
Well, I can get a refill later!

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:27.980
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:29.980
Become a butterfly!

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:39.450
Why can't I fly?

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:41.910
Ah, what's this!?

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:43.540
I do look like a butterfly, but...

00:08:44.250 --> 00:08:46.960
...what good does it do me if it's just a costume!?

00:08:48.380 --> 00:08:51.800
Ahh, I shouldn't have used any magic...

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.890
Ahhh, a monster cat!

00:09:01.720 --> 00:09:02.520
Hey you!

00:09:04.480 --> 00:09:07.270
You thieving cat, you've come to steal some fish again, haven't you!?

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:09.650
Take this! And this! And this!

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:11.860
Miss, you sure are strong!

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:13.150
Miss?

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:18.160
Sorry! I called ya Miss, but yer actually a young wife, right?

00:09:18.160 --> 00:09:20.280
You sure know how to compliment someone!

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:22.580
Young lady, what would you like?

00:09:22.580 --> 00:09:24.620
Two fresh mackerels, please.

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:27.120
Coming right up! I'll give you some bags as extra.

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:28.330
Thanks!

00:09:28.750 --> 00:09:31.630
She's a kid and yet she's using such obvious flattery...

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:32.880
Thanks for your patronage!

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:44.810
No way!

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:48.230
She's just an elementary school kid, but she's taking a taxi home!?

00:09:48.230 --> 00:09:49.110
Alright!

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:04.580
Fly straight!

00:10:14.090 --> 00:10:15.210
Doremi-chan?

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:17.260
H-Hi there...

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:42.320
Doremi-chan, thanks for comin' over!

00:10:42.320 --> 00:10:43.700
I'm so happy!

00:10:43.700 --> 00:10:46.080
I'm gonna make some takoyaki, so just wait a bit!

00:10:47.410 --> 00:10:49.080
Aiko! We have a guest?

00:10:49.080 --> 00:10:51.380
Ah, Dad! I'll introduce ya.

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:53.090
This is my classmate, Doremi-chan!

00:10:53.090 --> 00:10:54.290
Hello.

00:10:54.290 --> 00:10:55.460
Is that right!?

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:57.710
Thanks so much for comin'!

00:10:57.710 --> 00:11:00.470
Aiko, I can make the takoyaki for you!

00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:04.430
It's okay. I betcha yer tired Dad, so I'll make it!

00:11:04.430 --> 00:11:05.850
I WANT to make it.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:10.480
I was worried ya might be gettin' bullied, since ya just transferred.

00:11:10.480 --> 00:11:14.770
But instead, ya made a friend that came over to play!

00:11:14.770 --> 00:11:16.780
I'm really happy!

00:11:16.780 --> 00:11:19.820
How dumb! I'd pound 'em before they could bully me!

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:21.320
I guess that's true!

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:27.660
Seems like a nice family!

00:11:27.660 --> 00:11:30.580
'Kay then, I'll get the laundry.

00:11:30.580 --> 00:11:31.160
Sure.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.920
Doremi-chan, Dad's takoyaki's the best in the world!

00:11:35.920 --> 00:11:37.380
Just you wait!

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.720
Here ya go. Now go ahead and eat all ya like!

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:42.470
Sure.

00:11:42.470 --> 00:11:44.180
Thanks for the food!

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:49.140
This is the super-best ever!

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:51.810
Doremi-chan, yer talkin' in the Osaka dialect too!

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:52.890
Yup!

00:12:01.820 --> 00:12:03.360
Jeez, Dad...

00:12:03.360 --> 00:12:06.530
Ya just got to show off yer good points, and now you've gone and wrecked it.

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:08.620
Doremi-chan, let's go eat outside!

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:09.330
Sure.

00:12:14.620 --> 00:12:15.960
Sorry we gotta eat out here.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:18.960
Don't worry, the wind feels nice, so this is perfect.

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:22.630
My dad's workin' as a taxi driver.

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:26.470
So... That's why she was riding a taxi...

00:12:26.470 --> 00:12:30.640
We just moved here, so I think he's just tired after a hard day.

00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:31.770
Sorry 'bout that.

00:12:32.390 --> 00:12:33.850
You don't need to apologize.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.850
He's a really good dad!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:37.730
Really? Thanks!

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:39.860
Is your mom working too?

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:43.740
I ain't got a mom.

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:45.110
Eh... Ah...

00:12:45.110 --> 00:12:45.660
Sorry...

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:47.160
I don't mind. I don't mind.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:52.200
Mom left after fightin' with my dad when I was four.

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:54.660
Wipe that face off!

00:12:54.660 --> 00:12:58.540
It's completely okay with me to have no mom. Dad's here for me!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.630
Ya don't hafta feel pity!

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:02.840
I know, but I admire you.

00:13:02.840 --> 00:13:03.630
Huh?

00:13:03.630 --> 00:13:05.340
You're great, Ai-chan.

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.470
I don't do anything to help out around the house!

00:13:09.470 --> 00:13:12.560
I'm just doin' it 'cause there's no one else to do it!

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:13.680
But that's great!

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:16.350
Ya think so? Well then, should I be proud?

00:13:25.400 --> 00:13:27.030
Where would you like to go...?

00:13:28.740 --> 00:13:30.660
Ai-chan, good morning!

00:13:31.540 --> 00:13:34.500
'Morning, Doremi-chan, Hadzuki-chan!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:36.790
I heard about you from Doremi-chan.

00:13:36.790 --> 00:13:39.580
It looks like I was mistaken about you.

00:13:39.580 --> 00:13:40.840
I'm sorry.

00:13:40.840 --> 00:13:43.760
Me too! Looks like I went a bit too far yesterday.

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:44.840
Sorry.

00:13:44.840 --> 00:13:48.510
Don't worry. I'd like to meet your dad too.

00:13:48.510 --> 00:13:50.550
Doremi-chan said he's very nice!

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:52.930
You can meet him at Parents' Day, the day after tomorrow.

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.520
Ah, that's right!

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.940
Dad ain't comin'.

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:59.480
Eh? Why?

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:00.610
He's got work.

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:04.110
My mom has work too, but she's going to take time off to come.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:05.110
That's right!

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:07.150
If you tell him about it, I'm sure he'll come!

00:14:07.150 --> 00:14:11.410
Dad's a taxi driver, so he can't take time off that easily.

00:14:11.410 --> 00:14:14.910
He didn't come even once when we lived in Osaka, either.

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:18.830
If I tell Seki-sensei about it, she won't mind.

00:14:18.830 --> 00:14:20.040
I see...

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:27.010
Since I'm friends with Ai-chan now, maybe I can do something for her with magic...

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:31.350
Well then, if there were two of her dad, that would work, right?

00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:32.180
That's it!

00:14:32.180 --> 00:14:37.230
If I can make two of Ai-chan's dad, one of them can come to Parents' Day!

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.940
I see, that's how I can do it!

00:14:40.770 --> 00:14:41.860
Hey, say again?

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:46.070
You're out of magic spheres, so how do you think you're going to use magic?

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:47.900
Ahh, I forgot!

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:51.530
Hey, hey, hey, gimme some magic spheres! Gimme!

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:55.160
No way! I told you, you can't just have magic spheres for free!

00:14:55.160 --> 00:14:55.830
Stingy!

00:14:55.830 --> 00:14:59.580
Majo Rika, if she doesn't use magic, she'll never improve.

00:14:59.580 --> 00:15:01.460
Ah, that's true.

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:06.630
If you want to change back fast, you'd best give her some magic spheres.

00:15:08.510 --> 00:15:09.670
I guess I'll have to...

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:18.180
Use them carefully!

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:22.770
Really... I'll make you work extra hard this weekend to make up for this...

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:25.020
She left already.

00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:27.990
You little Ojamajo!

00:15:33.370 --> 00:15:34.240
Here's yer lunch.

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:36.240
Thanks. I'm headin' off now.

00:15:36.910 --> 00:15:38.290
Ah, Dad?

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:41.000
What's up, Aiko?

00:15:41.000 --> 00:15:43.210
No, never mind!

00:15:43.210 --> 00:15:45.710
Have a good day! Be careful.

00:15:45.710 --> 00:15:46.290
Yeah.

00:15:55.140 --> 00:15:56.470
Ai-chan's dad!

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:00.520
Ah, if it ain't Doremi-chan!

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:05.440
Parents' Day, huh?

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:10.150
I figured it would be hard for Ai-chan to tell you since you have work...

00:16:10.150 --> 00:16:14.200
If she'd told me earlier, I coulda tried tradin' shifts to get the day off, but...

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:16.530
I just started workin' for this company...

00:16:16.530 --> 00:16:18.120
It's just not possible for me to come.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:19.080
I see...

00:16:19.700 --> 00:16:22.330
Sorry about all this, even after you came and told me...

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:26.500
Can ya tell Aiko that I'll definitely come next time?

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:27.380
Sure.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:28.170
See ya, then.

00:16:34.340 --> 00:16:37.640
As I thought! I'll just have to use some magic!

00:16:51.570 --> 00:16:53.820
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:09.090
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:17:09.090 --> 00:17:11.510
Make Ai-chan's dad into two!

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:20.890
Looks like he didn't notice.

00:17:20.890 --> 00:17:23.310
I do say, why is there another one of me?

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:25.850
Ah! That's not the Osaka dialect!

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:29.360
Failed again...

00:17:30.150 --> 00:17:31.520
This isn't the time to be depressed!

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:36.280
Listen, you're Ai-chan's father, so you have to talk in the Osaka dialect!

00:17:36.280 --> 00:17:38.160
I absolutely and completely understand perfectly.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:41.120
Maybe you shouldn't talk too much...

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:45.480
Parents' Day starts at one in the afternoon, so make sure you aren't late!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:01.680
Looks like Ai-chan's dad didn't come after all.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.720
It's okay, he'll definitely come.

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:07.480
And I told him not to be late...

00:18:11.820 --> 00:18:14.480
Who wants to do the next problem?

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:16.070
Sugiyama!

00:18:16.070 --> 00:18:19.570
I can understand that you like your mom, but don't look back during class!

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.070
I'm scared...

00:18:21.070 --> 00:18:23.660
Whatever you do, don't do it wrong!

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:31.290
Jeez... What is he doing!?

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:36.050
Doesn't look like this one either.

00:18:36.050 --> 00:18:37.220
Thanks!

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:42.390
I might still be able to make it...

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:49.520
Class will be over in just two minutes!

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:51.230
That's strange...

00:18:52.310 --> 00:18:54.320
Well then, the last problem will be...

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:57.070
Sorry 'bout bein' late!

00:18:57.070 --> 00:18:58.610
Ah! Dad!

00:18:58.610 --> 00:18:59.490
Yo!

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:02.820
Dad, I didn't even tell ya, so why're ya here?

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:04.240
I heard from Doremi-chan!

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:06.790
Doremi-chan! That was unnecessary!

00:19:06.790 --> 00:19:09.290
Was it that bad?

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:10.540
Of course it was!

00:19:10.540 --> 00:19:15.630
Dad just started workin' at the company! He'll get fired for skippin' work!

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:17.920
Dummy! Whatcha gettin' mad for?

00:19:17.920 --> 00:19:21.130
Doremi-chan was just thinkin' of you when she told me.

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:23.090
Even with that...

00:19:23.090 --> 00:19:27.310
This is the first time you've come to school, Dad...

00:19:28.810 --> 00:19:31.140
Why... why are tears comin' out...

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:35.440
I just don't understand!

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:38.990
But... but...

00:19:38.990 --> 00:19:42.610
I'm really happy!

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:51.000
You dummy. Whatcha cryin' for?

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:11.270
Well then, for the new face in our class, will you do this last problem?

00:20:11.270 --> 00:20:12.690
Senoo Aiko!

00:20:12.690 --> 00:20:13.730
Ah, yes ma'am!!

00:20:15.810 --> 00:20:17.360
Ai-chan, fight!

00:20:25.950 --> 00:20:27.200
What's wrong, Aiko?

00:20:27.200 --> 00:20:29.290
It's kinda hard, I dunno how to do it.

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:35.750
Ya big dummy! We get all fired up and ya can't even solve the problem?

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:38.460
I can't help it, I'm <i>your</i>  daughter!

00:20:48.300 --> 00:20:51.060
Next Parents' Day, try not to embarrass me so much.

00:20:51.060 --> 00:20:53.810
Gotcha, now hurry up and get back to work!

00:20:53.810 --> 00:20:55.600
Well then, see you, Doremi-chan!

00:20:55.810 --> 00:20:58.820
Mister, your Osaka dialect was pretty good there!

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.360
Is there something wrong with the Osaka dialect?

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:04.650
I-It's nothing! Just talking to myself.

00:21:04.650 --> 00:21:06.240
See you mister!

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:11.660
Doremi-chan!

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:20.750
You didn't tell me what class you were in, so I was unable to find it!

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:25.170
I'm completely exhausted from running around the school.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:26.630
There are two Dads!?

00:21:26.630 --> 00:21:29.140
And why is he talkin' in the Tokyo dialect!?

00:21:29.140 --> 00:21:32.270
Ahh, then the one that was just here...

00:21:32.270 --> 00:21:34.270
...was the real one!?

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:39.150
H-He disappeared! What's goin' on?

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:40.940
Could that have been...

00:21:40.940 --> 00:21:42.860
W-What you just saw was an illusion!

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:44.400
Don't worry about it, don't worry about it!

00:21:44.400 --> 00:21:47.360
It was your doing after all, Doremi-chan!

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:48.780
Doremi-chan, you-

00:21:48.780 --> 00:21:51.950
Ahhhhh! Don't say it!

00:21:53.200 --> 00:21:54.750
W-What should I do...

00:21:54.750 --> 00:21:56.250
If she finds out I'm a witch...

00:21:56.250 --> 00:21:59.630
I'll turn into a Witch Frog!

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:06.260
Hey, hey! What would you guys do if you could use magic, Hadzuki-chan, Ai-chan?

00:22:06.260 --> 00:22:08.180
Who, me?

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:08.720
Yeah!

00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:12.470
First I'd make some takoyaki and eat 'til I was stuffed!

00:22:12.470 --> 00:22:15.680
I would make it so my favorite dolls could move!

00:22:15.680 --> 00:22:16.680
Right, right!?

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:19.850
So would you both like to become real witches?

00:22:21.360 --> 00:22:22.610
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:22.610 --> 00:22:24.530
It's Not Scary if We're All Witches.

00:22:25.150 --> 00:22:27.650
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
